5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I need to know if our past efforts actually changed anything for patients.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am concerned about whether the physical space can absorb another program.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I want to see where recent starts came apart in the second year.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I need to see the staffing records to understand where the pressure lands.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,I must understand what this budget can actually build and earn back.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, space is vital, but without patient impact, it is just noise.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, agreed. But if the rooms seize up, the impact is zero.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Servas, the budget is a trap if the structure fails. I will check the failures.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, the structure fails because the people are stretched thin. I will check the rosters.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Yumi, the people are the foundation. I will check the ledger to see the true cost.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will look at the readmission figures and the board minutes on the joint clinic.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"I will examine the rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, and the booking system records.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will review the board minutes on a jointly run clinic and the data agreements with outside surgeries.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I will check the ward nursing vacancies and the therapy and midwifery staffing review.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will examine this year's development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,The data will show if we are just adding to the pile of buried initiatives.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I need to know if the infrastructure can handle the load without breaking.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I will find out if the arrangements were ever truly signed up to.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I hope the staffing data shows we can support this without burning out the teams.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Let us see what the money can truly buy, not just what it promises.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
